@* Wrapper for a section label. The MudBlazor typography member it names is spelled with a word the
   scaffold renames, and razor markup has no escape form for a single occurrence, so this file is
   declared copyOnly in .template.config/template.json: it ships verbatim, and must therefore stay
   free of every seed token. build/templates/stage.ps1 proves both halves of that. *@
<MudText Typo="Typo.subtitle1" GutterBottom="true">@ChildContent</MudText>

@code {
    [Parameter] public RenderFragment? ChildContent { get; set; }
}
